### File: C:\xampp\htdocs\appF\api-tests.http
### FitCoach Pro API Testing with REST Client
### Click "Send Request" above each request to execute

@baseUrl = http://localhost/appF/api

### ============================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION TESTS
### ============================================

### 1.1 Login as Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth.php?action=login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@fitcoach.com",
    "password": "Admin@123",
    "remember": false
}

### 1.2 Check Login Status (Should show logged in)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth.php?action=check
Content-Type: application/json

### 1.3 Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth.php?action=logout
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 1.4 Login as Coach
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth.php?action=login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "sarah@fitcoach.com",
    "password": "Admin@123",
    "remember": false
}

