### ============================================
### 2. SETTINGS TESTS (Admin Only)
### ============================================

### 2.1 Get All Settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/settings.php
Content-Type: application/json

### 2.2 Get Specific Setting
GET {{baseUrl}}/settings.php?key=site_name
Content-Type: application/json

### 2.3 Update Site Name
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "key": "site_name",
    "value": "FitCoach Pro - Live",
    "type": "text"
}

