### ============================================
### 4. PROGRESS TESTS
### ============================================

### 4.1 Get Measurements for Client 3
GET {{baseUrl}}/progress.php?client_id=3&metric=measurements
Content-Type: application/json

### 4.2 Add Body Measurement (March 27, 2024)
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress.php?action=measurement
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "client_id": 3,
    "date": "2024-03-27",
    "weight": 84.8,
    "waist": 86,
    "chest": 102,
    "arms": 34,
    "thighs": 58,
    "body_fat": 18.5,
    "notes": "Week 8 check-in - making good progress!"
}

### 4.3 Add Another Body Measurement (March 20, 2024)
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress.php?action=measurement
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "client_id": 3,
    "date": "2024-03-20",
    "weight": 85.5,
    "waist": 87,
    "chest": 103,
    "arms": 34,
