### 4.4 Verify Measurements Added
GET {{baseUrl}}/progress.php?client_id=3&metric=measurements
Content-Type: application/json

### 4.5 Get Weight Progress (Last 8 weeks)
GET {{baseUrl}}/progress.php?client_id=3&metric=weight&weeks=8
Content-Type: application/json

### 4.6 Add Fitness Test Result (Strength)
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress.php?action=fitness_test
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "client_id": 3,
    "test_type": "1RM Bench Press",
    "date": "2024-03-27",
    "result": 225,
    "unit": "lbs",
    "notes": "New PR! Increased by 10lbs from last month"
}

### 4.7 Add Endurance Test Result
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress.php?action=fitness_test
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "client_id": 3,
    "test_type": "1.5 Mile Run",
    "date": "2024-03-27",
    "result": 11.5,
    "unit": "minutes",
    "notes": "Improved by 45 seconds"
}

### 4.8 Add Flexibility Test Result
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress.php?action=fitness_test
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "client_id": 3,
    "test_type": "Sit and Reach",
    "date": "2024-03-27",
